// Copy to Config/Secrets.xcconfig (git-ignored) with the production project's values: its URL and its
// legacy "anon" key (Project Settings > API Keys; docs/runbooks/release.md writes both with the Supabase CLI).
// Release builds read it, and `make archive` refuses another project's (MS-152).
// To point a Debug build at a hosted project (staging) instead of the local stack it uses by default,
// copy it to Config/Secrets.debug.xcconfig with that project's values.
// xcconfig treats "//" as a comment, so write the URL scheme as https:/$()/
SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = your-anon-key
// Sentry DSN from the project's Client Keys page. Leave empty to keep crash reporting off (MS-108).
SENTRY_DSN = https:/$()/public-key@o0.ingest.sentry.io/0
// PostHog project token (phc_…) from Project settings, General. Leave empty to keep analytics off (MS-147).
// The host defaults to the EU cloud; set POSTHOG_HOST = https:/$()/us.i.posthog.com for a US project.
POSTHOG_PROJECT_TOKEN =
// Debug builds pointed at a hosted project: the reset link must be one of the project's redirect URLs
// (Authentication, URL Configuration). Uncomment to use the universal link instead of dentory://.
// PASSWORD_RESET_URL = https:/$()/app.dentory.ca/reset-password
